      "en": "Important workflow changes go through a PR: the diff shows what changed (a node added, a condition edited, a URL changed). To keep diffs readable: clear node names, and do not move nodes around on the canvas needlessly. In review, look for: secrets typed into parameters, production URLs in dev, a missing error workflow."
